msgid "Avionics Anonymous GNSS/Mag"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:7
#: 0cac6a9dc7d54b819c051e90a705b688
msgid "The `Avionics Anonymous GNSS/Mag <https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/gnssmag>`__ is a high-performance combination GPS and magnetometer for small unmanned vehicles. It includes a uBlox SAM-M8Q integrated multi-constellation GNSS unit and a high-quality Memsic MMC5983MA magnetometer enabling better than 1-degree heading accuracy. The device interfaces to your autopilot via a robust `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ interface, which provides high reliability connections to peripherals over greater distances than I2C."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:18
#: e5dede880992498ba154a8e71cbeaef1
msgid "The following parameters should be set on the autopilot (and then reboot the autopilot):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:20
#: a871de08eb144f8cb1fbb2fcfa6a7285
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the 1st CAN port)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:21
#: bee970a1e41344e5a05a114abf5602f6
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 9 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:23
#: 32c60391e56e4560b2dab6035ad830b6
msgid "If the device does not work please follow the instructions on enabling the CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` page, followed by :ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps and then set the :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` or :ref:`GPS2_TYPE <GPS2_TYPE>` parameter to 9."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:25
#: 292e14e68a5846bbb6dcc790d838ddfb
msgid "The `manufacturer's product page is here <https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/gnssmag>`__ for general information about the device."
msgstr ""
